sign \x2030 347 PER MILLE SIGN
punctuation \x2039 1234567 SINGLE LEFT-POINTING ANGLE QUOTATION MARK
punctuation \x203A 1234568 SINGLE RIGHT-POINTING ANGLE QUOTATION MARK
