punctuation \x0093 236
punctuation \x0094 356
punctuation \x0096 36
sign \x00a1 45-56-235 ¡
punctuation \x00a1 235 ¡
sign \x00a2 4-14 ¢ cent
sign \x00a3 4-123 £ pound
sign \x00a4 1246 ¤ currency
sign \x00a5 4-13456 ¥ yen
