sign \x2022 456-256 •   bullet
punctuation \x2026 3-3-3 …   ellipsis
space \x202f 0   narrow no-break space
sign \x2032 3 ′   prime (derivative)
sign \x2033 3-3 ″   double prime (second derivative)


